# PNC Student Progress Tracking System (SPTS) - Web App Environment Configuration
#
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file to '.env' in the same directory:
#    cp .env.example .env
# 2. Modify the variables below to match your local or remote development setup.
# 3. Restart the Vite development server after changing any environment variables.
#
# NOTE: Environment variables prefixed with 'VITE_' are exposed to the client-side code.

# =========================================================================
# 1. VITE_PROXY_TARGET (Development Mode Only)
# =========================================================================
# The target server for the Vite dev proxy. Requests beginning with:
# - '/api'
# - '/uploads'
# - '/teacher-images'
# will be proxied here. This prevents CORS issues during development.
#
# Option A: Local NestJS Backend API (Default fallback in code)
# VITE_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:3000
#
# Option B: Staging Remote API
# VITE_PROXY_TARGET=https://pnc-spts-stg-api.me
#
VITE_PROXY_TARGET=https://pnc-spts-stg-api.me

# =========================================================================
# 2. VITE_API_BASE_URL (Production Mode Only)
# =========================================================================
# The absolute base URL of the API server used in production bundles where
# Vite's dev proxy is no longer active.
#
# Option A: Local Backend API (Fallback if not provided)
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000
#
# Option B: Staging Remote API
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://pnc-spts-stg-api.me
#
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://pnc-spts-stg-api.me
